---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ShiftLedger Support — BramLabs"
  description="Support for ShiftLedger by BramLabs."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="meta"><a href="/studio/">Studio</a> · ShiftLedger</p>
      <h1 class="h-section">ShiftLedger Support</h1>
      <p class="lead">Help with ShiftLedger rotation planning, schedule tools and account or install issues.</p>

      <h2>Contact support</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:support@bramlabs.co">support@bramlabs.co</a> with:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Product name (ShiftLedger)</li>
        <li>Device / browser version</li>
        <li>What you expected vs what happened</li>
        <li>Screenshots if useful (no passwords or secrets)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We aim to respond within a few business days.</p>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I install or open ShiftLedger?</summary>
        <p>
          Use the official store listing when available, or the platform where you
          originally installed the product. Avoid third-party APK or extension mirrors.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Why is a feature missing or different?</summary>
        <p>
          Products may ship in stages. If something regressed after an update, include
          your version number and we will investigate.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Does BramLabs sell my data?</summary>
        <p>
          No. See the product privacy policy for what is collected when you contact
          support or use network features.
        </p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I report a security issue?</summary>
        <p>
          Email support@bramlabs.co with subject line “Security” and a clear description.
          Do not include exploit details in public forums.
        </p>
      </details>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn -primary" href="mailto:support@bramlabs.co">support@bramlabs.co</a>
        <a class="btn -link" href="/apps/shiftledger/privacy/">Privacy policy →</a>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .prose {
    max-width: 42rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .prose h1, .prose h2 {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .prose ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  details {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    background: var(--canvas);
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
    min-height: 28px;
  }
  details p {
    margin-top: 0.65rem;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose a:not(.btn) {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
